# Workspace Tab Shell Constitution

When building or refactoring detail/workspace pages (template dev editor, master revision, content-module lifecycle, etc.):

1. **Journey/timeline** = visual progress only — no CTA buttons.
2. **Top-level workspace tabs** = work phases — one right-aligned action rail on the tab row.
3. **Nested sub-tabs** = content navigation only — no buttons.
4. **Supplemental input** = modal/dialog — never inline textarea in workflow bars.

Reference: `WorkspaceTabShell.vue`, `TemplateDetailDevWorkspace.vue`, `docs/architecture/management-ui-constitution.md`.
